horizontal_alignment = 1

[node name="Body" type="RichTextLabel" parent="HowToPanel/Panel/Margin/VBox" unique_id=1102938477]
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_vertical = 3
theme_override_constants/line_separation = 2
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 18
theme_override_font_sizes/bold_font_size = 18
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[color=#ffd27f]THE GOAL[/color]
One player is the [color=#ff5a55]Sili[/color] - the tagger. Everyone else is a [color=#5aa6ff]Tubig[/color] - a runner.
The Sili wins by putting every Tubig out of the match. The Tubig win if even one of them is still free when the 3:00 clock reaches zero.

[color=#ffd27f]CONTROLS[/color]
Move - WASD or the Arrow Keys
Sprint - hold Shift
E - hold to rescue a burning teammate, tap to take a tunnel

Sprinting drains your stamina bar. Empty it and you are exhausted for 2 seconds and cannot run at all. Both roles share the same stamina.

[color=#ffd27f]PLAYING AS TUBIG[/color]
- You have 3 hearts. Every tag costs one permanently. A rescue does not give it back.
- Being tagged sets you burning: you are rooted where you stand for 15 seconds. A teammate who stands next to you and holds E for 6 seconds pulls you out. If nobody reaches you in time you are out for the rest of the match, and losing your last heart takes you out immediately.
- Rescues shut off for the final 45 seconds. Anything that lands after that is final.
- Hiding spots: stand still inside one for a moment and you go HIDDEN, dropping your dot off the team minimap. You are not invisible in the world - the Sili can still walk into you and tag you.
- Tunnels: step into a mouth and press E to surface at the far end. Three trips per match, then they are spent. A burning teammate beside you always wins the key over the tunnel.
- Your minimap shows teammates in blue. The Sili appears in red only while somebody on your team has them on screen.

[color=#ffd27f]PLAYING AS SILI[/color]
- You start at exactly the same walk and run speed as the Tubig, so you cannot simply outrun anyone early on.
- You get faster as the clock drops: 1.12x at 0:30 elapsed, 1.26x at 1:05, 1.42x at 1:40, and 1.60x at 2:15.
- Tagging is automatic. Touch a Tubig and they ignite - there is no button to press.
- Your minimap only shows Tubig you have already tagged, so it stays empty until your first catch.

[color=#ffd27f]BEFORE THE MATCH[/color]
Everyone is shown who the Sili is during a 5 second reveal, and nobody can move until the countdown ends."

